				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Overview &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data analysis project for a fictional mining company called &lt;strong&gt;Metals R&amp;rsquo; Us&lt;/strong&gt;, using real-world data from a flotation plant. The goal was to investigate process quality — specifically iron concentrate purity — and identify anomalies in the production data.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dataset:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/edumagalhaes/quality-prediction-in-a-mining-process&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Kaggle — Quality Prediction in a Mining Process&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;strong&gt;Notebook:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://deepnote.com/app/data-analystics-accelerator/Mining-Project-7983f6fd-8b68-4392-811b-e4f6145de140&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;View on Deepnote&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;problem-statement&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Problem statement &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#problem-statement&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The engineering team flagged an anomaly on &lt;strong&gt;June 1, 2017&lt;/strong&gt; and needed a data analyst to investigate what happened to the iron concentrate quality on that day. Key variables of interest were:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
